    /// <summary>
    /// The **<c>Document.body</c>** property represents the &lt;body&gt; or &lt;frameset&gt; node of the current document, or null if no such element exists.
    ///
    /// [MDN Reference](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/API/Document/body)
