    /// <summary>
    /// The **<c>visualViewport</c>** read-only property of the Window interface returns a VisualViewport object representing the visual viewport for a given window, or null if current document is not fully active.
    ///
    /// [MDN Reference](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/API/Window/visualViewport)
    /// </summary>
